OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUK announces sanctions on Israeli
OL,4,Asettlements in West Bank and accuses
OL,5,Asettlers of 'ethnic cleansing'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe also says France and Canada will
OL,8,Fjoin the UK in imposing sanctions on
OL,9,FIsraeli settlements in the West Bank,
OL,10,Fwhich are illegal under international
OL,11,Flaw
OL,13,FIt's since been announced that nine
OL,14,Fother countries will do the same:
OL,15,FDenmark, Spain, Finland, Ireland,
OL,16,FIceland, Norway, Poland, Portugal and
OL,17,FSweden
OL,19,FThe sanctions come as Israel plans to
OL,20,Fdevelop 1,200 new homes in the occupied
OL,21,FWest Bank and amid a rise in settler
OL,22,Fattacks on Palestinians this year
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/41
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
