OL,3,AUK announces sanctions on Israeli
OL,4,Asettlements in West Bank and accuses
OL,5,Asettlers of 'ethnic cleansing'
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, Israeli and US officials
OL,8,Fwarned the UK over the restrictions -
OL,9,FIsrael's President Isaac Herzog called
OL,10,Fthem a "grave miscalculation"
OL,12,FMeanwhile, US ambassador to Israel Mike
OL,13,FHuckabee told the BBC British firms
OL,14,Fcould be "banned" from doing business
OL,15,Fin a number of US states
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/41
