OL,3,APrince George begins first day at a
OL,4,Arainy Eton College
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey made small talk about the bad
OL,7,Fweather before the new pupil, parents
OL,8,Fand staff disappeared inside the
OL,9,Fhistoric school, where 13-year-old
OL,10,FGeorge will be a boarder.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/41
