OL,3,APolice search for two thieves who stole
OL,4,ARenoir paintings worth millions from
OL,5,AFrench museum
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are searching for two thieves
OL,8,Fwho stole four Renoir paintings from a
OL,9,FFrench museum, before dropping two in
OL,10,Fthe gardens as they fled the scene
OL,12,FThe local mayor's office says the
OL,13,Fbreak-in was carried out by two
OL,14,F"clearly organised, equipped and
OL,15,Fwell-informed" individuals and that
OL,16,F"every possible effort" is being made
OL,17,Fto find them and the two missing
OL,18,Fpaintings
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/41
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
